<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Sabat</title><link>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/</link><description>Recent content on Sabat</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 21:19:36 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Notes from learning golang</title><link>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/learning_golang/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 21:19:36 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/learning_golang/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="project">
 Project
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#project">
 &lt;i class="fa fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading">&lt;/i>
 &lt;span class="sr-only">Link to heading&lt;/span>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>To create module (go.mod) run &lt;code>go mod init &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/code>&lt;br>
To get dependencies to project run &lt;code>go mod tidy&lt;/code>&lt;br>
To install (download) package run &lt;code>go install &amp;lt;package&amp;gt;@latest&lt;/code> or any version&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Search packages at &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/'">https://pkg.go.dev/'&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>compilation: &lt;code>go build -o output/path/app src/&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="switch">
 Switch
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#switch">
 &lt;i class="fa fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading">&lt;/i>
 &lt;span class="sr-only">Link to heading&lt;/span>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">const&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">A&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">int8&lt;/span> = &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">25&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// switch with input variable&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">switch&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">A&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;A is 10&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">20&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;A is 20&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">default&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;A is something else&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// switch that can use any bool statements as case&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">switch&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">A&lt;/span> &amp;gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;A is more than 10&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">A&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;lt;=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;A is less than 10&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// switch with 2 expresions as input&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">switch&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">B&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">30&lt;/span>; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">B&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;B is 10&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">case&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">20&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;B is 20&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="http-client">
 Http client
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#http-client">
 &lt;i class="fa fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading">&lt;/i>
 &lt;span class="sr-only">Link to heading&lt;/span>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#f92672">import&lt;/span> (
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;net/http&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;io&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">func&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">TestHttpClient&lt;/span>() {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// Create client&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">client&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">http&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Client&lt;/span> { &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Timeout&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">time&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Second&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">*&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// Create request&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">req&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">http&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">NewRequest&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;GET&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;http://www.google.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">nil&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">if&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">nil&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Error creating request&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// Call request&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">response&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">client&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Do&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">req&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">if&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">nil&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Error sending request&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// You need to close Body, otherwise connections stay open&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">defer&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">response&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Body&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Close&lt;/span>()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#75715e">// Read body&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">body&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">io&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">ReadAll&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">response&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Body&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">if&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">nil&lt;/span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>		&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Error reading body&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">err&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>	&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">fmt&lt;/span>.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Println&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">body&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>Introduction to Terraform</title><link>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/intro_to_terraform/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 13:49:36 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/intro_to_terraform/</guid><description>&lt;p>Terraform is tool for managing infrastructure. IaC or &amp;lsquo;Infrastructure as
a code&amp;rsquo; is process of managing you infrastrucutre with set of tools and human
readable files instead of manually setting it in configuration tools.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="installation">
 Installation
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#installation">
 &lt;i class="fa fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading">&lt;/i>
 &lt;span class="sr-only">Link to heading&lt;/span>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>To use Terraform you need to install it. All necessary infromation can be
found at &lt;a href="https://www.terraform.io/">official website&lt;/a>. On linux machines
use package manager&lt;/p>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>sudo pacman -S terraform
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;p>If everything was installed correctly you can check it with&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>My chess program post mortem</title><link>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/chess_retrospective/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 May 2023 22:22:26 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://tabas32.github.io/web_sabat/posts/chess_retrospective/</guid><description>&lt;p>Ok, I would be lying if I said that this is my first-ever program
